### 게시글 전체 조회
GET /v1/posts/all
Host: localhost:8080
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "postDate": "2024-04-12"
}

### 게시글 상세 조회
GET /v1/posts/detail/1
Host: localhost:8080
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 연관된 게시글 조회
GET /v1/posts/related/1?page=0&size=5
Host: localhost:8080
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
